颈骨密度变化以及骨转换标志物P1NP和CTX的变化。安全性评价重点关注主要不良心血管事件（MACE）、注射部位反应和低钙血症。本研究不设置探索性目的或探索性终点。","rationale":"研究目的、设计要素（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、1:1、12个月）、主要终点（复合：12个月新发椎体骨折＋腰椎BMD变化）、次要终点（非椎体骨折、临床骨折、全髋/股骨颈BMD、P1NP、CTX）和安全性终点（MACE、注射部位反应、低钙血症）均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。'不设置探索性目的/终点'为默认处理，因允许来源未列出任何探索性目的。医学经理需确认：影像学判读方法（如Genant半定量法）、BMD检测设备及中心、骨转换标志物检测实验室及方法、MACE判定委员会设置。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究目的和终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_397d779b01dc7ead","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1f3f6b81aae8ee","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006005423_15fa4102","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","quote":"主要终点：复合主要终点：12个月新发椎体骨折；12个月腰椎BMD相对基线百分比变化。","quote_sha256":"dbfa88595fa4814b9bffcef4f52ed771e00655a917ba26a14e678d699f0410d8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_e54ab29f43100c76:full-draft:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","quote":"复合主要终点：12个月新发椎体骨折；12个月腰椎BMD相对基线百分比变化。","quote_sha256":"a00e31b0eb90cfe086a7286688c5c937996be8b1efa66bc3c333762888270cd2","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","span_id":"es_005"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004","es_005"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"主要目的和主要终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的主要目的是评价SLN-611 210mg每月一次皮下注射治疗12个月对比匹配安慰剂在降低绝经后骨质疏松症受试者骨折风险和增加腰椎骨密度方面的优效性。主要终点为复合主要终点，由以下两个组分共同构成：（1）12个月新发椎体骨折发生率，通过影像学判读确定；（2）12个月腰椎骨密度（BMD）相对基线的百分比变化。两个组分均达到优效性标准方可判定主要终点成功。疗效评价在治疗策略（treatment policy）下进行，即无论受试者是否依从研究药物或是否使用合并用药，均按随机分组进行分析。","rationale":"复合主要终点（12个月新发椎体骨折＋腰椎BMD相对基线百分比变化）和影像学判读方式来自当前项目已确认研究事实。治疗策略（treatment policy）估计目标策略亦为已确认设计事实。'两个组分均达到优效性标准方可判定主要终点成功'为复合终点的标准解读，需医学经理确认是否采用此判定规则或另有权重/层级设计。影像学判读的具体方法（如Genant半定量法、中心阅片流程）未在允许来源中明确。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（主要目的和主要终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_0c432061a07dc066","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1f3f6b81aae8ee","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006005423_15fa4102","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","quote":"关键次要终点：非椎体骨折、临床骨折、全髋/股骨颈BMD、P1NP、CTX。","quote_sha256":"b9df4adebb6512805eaaee793d2ff42fc3544ee265d8968194a133410d42a739","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_e54ab29f43100c76:full-draft:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","quote":"非椎体骨折、临床骨折、全髋/股骨颈BMD、P1NP、CTX。","quote_sha256":"e23d3fd1598904fa7840f05c20dc932a8b407390f28056ffb0d1e0408686c18a","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","span_id":"es_007"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_006","es_007"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"次要目的和次要终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的次要目的是进一步评价SLN-611对骨质疏松性骨折的广泛保护作用、对髋部骨密度的影响以及对骨转换的调节效应。次要终点包括：（1）12个月非椎体骨折发生率；（2）12个月临床骨折发生率；（3）12个月全髋骨密度和股骨颈骨密度较基线的百分比变化；（4）骨转换标志物P1NP（I型前胶原氨基端前肽）和CTX（I型胶原C端肽）较基线的变化，作为药效学监测指标。骨转换标志物的采集时间点为基线、第1个月、第3个月、第6个月和第12个月。安全性评价中，主要不良心血管事件（MACE）、注射部位反应和低钙血症作为安全性终点进行监测。本研究不设置探索性目的或探索性终点。","rationale":"次要终点（非椎体骨折、临床骨折、全髋/股骨颈BMD、P1NP、CTX）和安全性终点（MACE、注射部位反应、低钙血症）来自当前项目已确认研究事实。骨转换标志物采集时间点（基线、1、3、6、12个月）来自访视策略。P1NP/CTX作为药效学监测指标的定位来自药理/PD考虑。医学经理需确认：非椎体骨折和临床骨折的具体定义及判定标准、BMD检测部位和设备、P1NP/CTX检测方法及实验室、MACE的判定委员会和具体事件类型清单。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_46dfb2b41f3b9902","section_number":"3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1f3f6b81aae8ee","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"c29087cfe04754ff4eae8a57297453187a4ac6cab3fc2fe66a6ccb6d0c78178e","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_e54ab29f43100c76:full-draft:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:d4bcfda355db92494e1792b8a712f5912f5c5f0842d8a34c2adf2dcffe0add9e:107475bbc1abc02b146e4b99","text_sha256":"c29087cfe04754ff4eae8a57297453187a4ac6cab3fc2fe66a6ccb6d0c78178e"},{"content_